## OptionalDeps: LibDataBroker-1.1, LibDBIcon-1.0, LibSharedMedia-3.0

# --- Libraries ---
#
# Five folders, two features. LibDBIcon hard-errors without LibDataBroker,
# which needs CallbackHandler, which needs LibStub - four of them for one
# minimap button, and the reason that is worth it is in MinimapButton.lua's
# header. LibSharedMedia rides on the same LibStub and CallbackHandler and is
# what fills the font and sound dropdowns; see the media block in TagTeam.lua.
#
# Load order here is the dependency order and nothing else.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibSharedMedia-3.0\LibSharedMedia-3.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

# --- Main ---
# Load order is a dependency chain: WallhackUiKit needs nothing, the core
# exports to TagTeamView, and SlashCommands reads ns.ToggleView from it.
#
# WallhackUiKit.lua is shared verbatim with WhoDoesWhat - see its header before editing.
TagTeam.lua
WallhackUiKit.lua
TagTeamView.lua
MinimapButton.lua
SlashCommands.lua
